@PortYard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5166

### List containers (paginated, optionally filtered)
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### List containers in a specific block, status, size, or shipping line
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers?status=Stored&block=A
Accept: application/json

### Register a new container (pre-advised, not yet arrived)
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "containerNumber": "MSCU1234566",
  "size": "FortyFoot",
  "type": "DryVan",
  "grossWeightKg": 18000,
  "shippingLine": "MSC"
}

### Full detail for one container: current slot, active holds, movement history
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566
Accept: application/json

### Gate the container in: Expected -> GatedIn
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566/gate-in

### Assign it to a yard slot: GatedIn/Staged -> Stored (or a re-yard if already Stored)
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566/assign-slot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotCode": "A01-1"
}

### Place a customs hold — blocks gate-out until released
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Random compliance check"
}

### Release a customs hold by its id (use the id returned above)
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/holds/1/release

### Stage the container for departure: GatedIn/Stored -> Staged
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566/stage

### Gate it out: Staged -> GatedOut (409 while any hold is still active)
POST {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/containers/MSCU1234566/gate-out

### List every yard slot with current occupancy and remaining TEU
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/slots
Accept: application/json

### Detail for one slot, including the containers currently in it
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/slots/A01-1
Accept: application/json

### Report: yard utilisation by block
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/yard-utilisation
Accept: application/json

### Report: dwell time by shipping line and container type
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/dwell-time
Accept: application/json

### Report: daily gate throughput (defaults to the last 30 days)
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/throughput
Accept: application/json

### Report: throughput over an explicit date range
GET {{PortYard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/throughput?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31
Accept: application/json
